lassName=\"text-gray-500\">Get notified when a candidate accepts or rejects an offer.</p>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </fieldset>\n            <fieldset>\n              <legend className=\"text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900\">Push Notifications</legend>\n              <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm leading-6 text-gray-600\">These are delivered via SMS to your mobile phone.</p>\n              <div className=\"mt-6 space-y-6\">\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-x-3\">\n                  <input id=\"push-everything\" name=\"push-notifications\" type=\"radio\" className=\"h-4 w-4 border-gray-300 text-indigo-600 focus600\" />\n                  <label htmlFor=\"push-everything\" className=\"block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-gray-900\">Everything</label>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-x-3\">\n                  <input id=\"push-email\" name=\"push-notifications\" type=\"radio\" className=\"h-4 w-4 border-gray-300 text-indigo-600 focus600\" />\n                  <label htmlFor=\"push-email\" className=\"block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-gray-900\">Same as email</label>\n                </div>\n                <div className=\"flex items-center gap-x-3\">\n                  <input id=\"push-nothing\" name=\"push-notifications\" type=\"radio\" className=\"h-4 w-4 border-gray-300 text-indigo-600 focus600\" />\n                  <label htmlFor=\"push-nothing\" className=\"block text-sm font-medium leading-6 text-gray-900\">No push notifications</label>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            </fieldset>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    \n      <div className=\"mt-6 flex items-center justify-end gap-x-6\">\n        <button type=\"button\" className=\"text-sm font-semibold leading-6 text-gray-900\">Cancel</button>\n        <button type=\"submit\" className=\"rounded-md bg-indigo-600 px-3 py-2 text-sm font-semibold text-white shadow-sm hover500 focus-visible focus-visible2 focus-visible2 focus-visible600\">Save</button>\n      </div>\n    </form>\n    </div>\n  );\n}\n",
